From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 04:16:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(server): bring session label deletes and project
 defaults up to its PR

A null label on session create leaves a project default off the new session,
replacing apply_project_labels; malformed label keys are rejected with a 400
before the write; PATCH applies deletes and upserts in one store transaction
(set_labels(delete_keys=...)); is_internal_label_key() is shared by project
defaults and the store. Matches
https://github.com/omnigent-ai/omnigent/pull/11398.

Signed-off-by: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
